: "后梁建立者。907年在大梁称帝，912年在宫廷政变中被杀。", "status": "draft", "id": "0555e455-34d4-54ef-b93e-b0e6425018ab"}, {"name": "孙儒", "aliases": [], "era": "晚唐", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "《资治通鉴》卷256中和四年条所见人物：孙儒。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "4426793f-0bd8-5a79-919f-7e3a0ddae520"}]'::jsonb)
